      "content": "liberating? i dont know if i can feel that. it just feels heavy. like if everything is actually meaningless, then every single thing i do—the work, the people i love, even just waking up every morning—it's all just... fake. if there's no point, then why am i even carrying this weight around? it feels like i'm just performing a role for no audience.",
